        tokiOS, tokiMind, tokiLab, VICA, and related technical materials may
        describe experimental or evolving systems. Architecture, interfaces,
        capabilities, benchmarks, and implementation details may change as the
        research and platform develop.
      </p>

      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        Information on this site is provided for research, technical, and
        informational purposes on an as-is basis, without warranties of any kind
        to the extent permitted by applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party names and technologies</h2>
